WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:09.550
[MUSIC] (SINGING) On
the red road, it's 1976.

00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:11.080
The bases are loaded.

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:21.430
On the red road, a blood maiden
is ruined from the start.

00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:27.746
It's tough to win two in a row.

00:00:27.746 --> 00:00:33.760
On the yellow road, it's 1976.

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:35.953
Give that ball a chase.

00:00:38.770 --> 00:00:42.280
I'm a seed.

00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:44.930
I'm a magician.

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:54.890
I'm the new man here
guided by invisible hands

00:00:54.890 --> 00:00:58.900
to an unknown end.

